{"ref":"powerup:duration","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Duration is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects how long the effects of certain weapons last."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 100% base Duration before modifications. The Duration in the stat panel is given as the difference to the base Duration, meaning that Duration stat of +30% equals to 130% total Duration, for example. Duration modifications from characters, PowerUps, and items stack additively. Other modifiers, such as Arcanas, stack multiplicatively with the collective bonus from the aforementioned."]},{"k":"p","c":["The upper limit of total Duration after character, PowerUp and item modifications is 500%. Bonuses from Arcanas are unaffected by the limit."]},{"k":"p","c":["Duration also affects:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Base Damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Four_Seasons.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:four-seasons"}," ",{"t":"Four Seasons","r":"weapon:four-seasons"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Godai_Shuffle.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:godai-shuffle"}," ",{"t":"Godai Shuffle","r":"weapon:godai-shuffle"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Hydro_Storm.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," ",{"t":"Hydro Storm","r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]},{"c":["Critical Damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Rune_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:rune-sword"}," ",{"t":"Rune Sword","r":"weapon:rune-sword"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]},{"c":[{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," of ",{"i":"Sprite-Santa_Javelin.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:santa-javelin"}," ",{"t":"Santa Javelin","r":"weapon:santa-javelin"}]}]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["DURATION"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["2"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+15%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+30%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 300"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Duration PowerUp increases Duration by +15% per rank, with a maximum rank of 2. At rank 2, it provides +30% Duration. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 300."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Duration"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+15%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+30%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Duration's associated passive item is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Spellbinder.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:spellbinder"}," ",{"t":"Spellbinder","r":"passive:spellbinder"},", which provides +10% Duration per level, up to a maximum of +50% Duration at level 5."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:silver-ring"}," ",{"t":"Silver Ring","r":"passive:silver-ring"}," also provides +5% per level, up to a maximum of +40% at level 9."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," provides +4%, then +3% per level, up to a maximum of +25% at level 8."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," has a chance of granting a Duration stat bonus of +4% upon activation."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Egg can permanently increase Duration by +1% for the character that collected it."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-arcana","title":"From arcana","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," provides +5% Duration when chosen per ",{"i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:revival"}," ",{"t":"Revival","r":"powerup:revival"}," consumed."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lost_&_Found_Painting_(XVII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:lost-found-painting-xvii"}," ",{"t":"Lost & Found Painting (XVII)","r":"arcana:lost-found-painting-xvii"}," provides a multiplier cycling between 0.5 to 1.5 every 10 s, and gives +1% Duration every level."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"from-characters-base-game","title":"Base Game","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Dommario.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:dommario"}," ",{"t":"Dommario","r":"character:dommario"}," starts with +40% Duration."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Poppea_Pecorina.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poppea-pecorina"}," ",{"t":"Poppea","r":"character:poppea-pecorina"}," gains +1% Duration every level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," ",{"t":"Gallo","r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," starts with +15% Duration."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Zi'Assunta_Belpaese.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:zi-assunta-belpaese"}," ",{"t":"Zi'Assunta","r":"character:zi-assunta-belpaese"}," gains +0.5% Duration every level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Exdash_Exiviiq.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"}," ",{"t":"Exdash","r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Toastie.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:toastie"}," ",{"t":"Toastie","r":"character:toastie"}," start with -10% Duration."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Smith_IV.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:smith-iv"}," ",{"t":"Smith","r":"character:smith-iv"}," starts with -10% Duration and gains +0.7% Duration every level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Minnah_Mannarah.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:minnah-mannarah"}," ",{"t":"Minnah","r":"character:minnah-mannarah"},"'s Duration cycles between multiplied by 2 and divided by 2 every minute."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-emergency-meeting","title":"Emergency Meeting","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crewmate_Dino.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," ",{"t":"Crewmate","r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," has a chance to gain a random amount of Duration every time a weapon or passive item is upgraded to its maximum level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Scientist_Mina.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:scientist-mina"}," ",{"t":"Scientist","r":"character:scientist-mina"}," can select to gain +1% Duration per level every 10 levels until level 50, for a maximum of up to +5% Duration per level."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-operation-guns","title":"Operation Guns","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lucia_Zero.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:lucia-zero"}," ",{"t":"Lucia","r":"character:lucia-zero"}," gains +4% Duration after ",{"t":"reviving","r":"powerup:revival"},", with no cap."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-ode-to-castlevania","title":"Ode to Castlevania","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Juste_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:juste-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Juste","r":"character:juste-belmont"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Charlotte_Aulin.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:charlotte-aulin"}," ",{"t":"Charlotte","r":"character:charlotte-aulin"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Barlowe.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:barlowe"}," ",{"t":"Barlowe","r":"character:barlowe"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Count_Olrox.png","w":14,"h":24,"r":"character:count-olrox"}," ",{"t":"Olrox","r":"charact